cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result tables, please cite the manuscript given under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "adfly-connectome: code and result tables of an in silico model of amyloid-like pathology on the Drosophila MaleCNS connectome"
abstract: "Leaky integrate-and-fire simulation of the adult male Drosophila central nervous system connectome (MaleCNS v1.0, 166,700 neurons) with graded amyloid-like pathology: simulation engine, network build scripts, design and analysis scripts, the per-fly result table of every design, the tables of named values behind every number in the manuscript, the figure scripts and the figures. The connectomes are not included. Licences: the code is under the MIT licence; the result tables, figures and build records are under CC BY 4.0, except six files derived from FlyWire data, which are under CC BY-NC 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md)."
authors:
